### 1. Get All Rooms (Public API - No Auth Required)
GET http://localhost:8765/api/rooms

###

### 2. Search Rooms (Case Insensitive - Partial Match)
GET http://localhost:8765/api/rooms/search?location=Maldive

###

### 3. Register a New User
POST http://localhost:8765/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demouser",
  "password": "password123",
  "email": "demo@test.com",
  "role": "USER"
}

###

### 4. Login User (Copy the JWT token from the response)
# @name loginRequest
POST http://localhost:8765/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demouser",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
%}

###

### 5. Get User Profile (Protected - Uses the token from previous step automatically)
GET http://localhost:8765/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### 6. Create a Booking (Protected - Uses the token automatically)
POST http://localhost:8765/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "roomName": "Ocean Breeze Deluxe",
  "roomType": "DELUXE",
  "location": "Maldives",
  "userId": "demouser",
  "checkIn": "2026-10-01",
  "checkOut": "2026-10-05",
  "guests": 2,
  "totalPrice": 74000
}
